title: mf gui progress
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Scripting the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Report progress for the running script (updates its task-bar entry)

Moves the running script's entry in the task bar: `--done` and `--total` draw a bar, `--phase` names the current step; only what is given changes ([[Status bar and task bar]]). The script is the one named by `METAFOLDER_GUI_TASK`, set by the GUI when it starts one, so outside the GUI this does nothing and succeeds.
